<blockquote class="uncited"><div><blockquote class="uncited"><div><br>However, my guess is now that perhaps you mean changing TGs within a TG list.<br></div></blockquote>Yes, the channels and TG in the channel were not switched. Everything worked in the menu. <br>Interestingly, when I changed the zone using "Fn+ arrow" (it didn't work right away), everything worked. I didn't reset it. <br>Thanks.</div></blockquote>I think the problem is a bug in the all versions of the firmware, because the current position in the TG list is stored in the settings , and is not reset when a new codeplug is loaded, and sometimes this can cause it to be not possible to change TG in the list<br><br>I can't remember the exact conditions when this can happen<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Wed Oct 26, 2022 10:34 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
