Correction. <br>After experimenting with codeplags, the following was observed: <br>1. After the failure of the joystick 1801 when switching the channel, the native codeplag was recorded - the joystick operation was restored.  <br>2. After importing channels, contacts and other things using GD77-CSV.exe from RT3S in 1801, the joystick also refused to work. After switching zones, the operation of the joystick was restored. <br>3. Re-firmware of the RT3S codeplag in 1801 did not cause the joystick to fail. <br><br>A New beta version 2022 10 19 was pre-installed on 1801. All manipulations were carried out by the latest version of CPS. <br>What caused the error is not clear, maybe there is an error in CSS when working with 1801?<br>Maybe I'm writing to the wrong address, and this is an error New Beta version 2022 10 19 for DM1801?<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1432">EU1AEQ</a> — Tue Oct 25, 2022 2:00 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
